{"id": "t066-055", "text": "team away day on 6 nov called off, budget. instead pizza in the office on the 7th at lunch. niamh organising. ricardo's still on sick leave w/ his back so wont be there. joseph new client from Usman & Co wants kickoff 10 nov 2pm, i'm leading it, kiara and dalia joining. sort the room b4 then", "spans": [{"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "6 nov"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "pizza in the office", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 7th at lunch", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "niamh", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "ricardo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "sick leave", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "joseph", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "client from Usman & Co", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "kickoff", "owner": "p3", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "10 nov 2pm", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "kiara", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "dalia", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "sort the room", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "b4 then", "anchor": "a1"}]}
