{"id": "t066-057", "text": "caught up w/ Grace at lunch. her brother Thabo's wife is pregnant w/ their first, due 14 feb lol valentines baby. grace is going to be an auntie and is v excited. she's knitting a blanket. also grace got the senior role she interviewed for, starts after xmas. send congrats card", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Grace", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "lunch"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Thabo", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "pregnant", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "due", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "14 feb", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "grace", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "excited", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "grace", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "senior role", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "starts", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "after xmas", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send congrats card", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "congratulate", "timing": "after"}]}
